{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "providers": [
    {
      "id": "deepseek",
      "displayName": "DeepSeek",
      "piProvider": "deepseek",
      "protocol": "openai-completions",
      "baseUrl": "https://api.deepseek.com",
      "envVar": "DEEPSEEK_API_KEY",
      "auth": { "header": "Authorization", "scheme": "Bearer" },
      "notes": "官方 OpenAI 兼容入口，不使用任何 coding 套餐地址。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "DeepSeek API Docs — Your First API Call",
          "url": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/en/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kimi",
      "displayName": "Kimi",
      "piProvider": "moonshotai-cn",
      "protocol": "openai-completions",
      "baseUrl": "https://api.moonshot.cn/v1",
      "envVar": "MOONSHOT_API_KEY",
      "auth": { "header": "Authorization", "scheme": "Bearer" },
      "region": "cn",
      "notes": "选择中国大陆区（platform.kimi.com）：官方快速开始给出 base_url=https://api.moonshot.cn/v1 与 MOONSHOT_API_KEY。国际区 platform.kimi.ai（api.moonshot.ai）首版不混用；不使用面向 coding agent 的套餐地址。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Kimi API 开放平台 — 快速开始",
          "url": "https://platform.kimi.com/docs/get-api-key"
        },
        {
          "title": "Kimi API 开放平台 — 模型列表",
          "url": "https://platform.kimi.com/docs/models"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "glm",
      "displayName": "智谱 GLM",
      "piProvider": "zai",
      "protocol": "openai-completions",
      "baseUrl": "https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4",
      "envVar": "ZAI_API_KEY",
      "auth": { "header": "Authorization", "scheme": "Bearer" },
      "region": "cn",
      "notes": "智谱 BigModel 普通 OpenAI 兼容 API（open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4），不采用 pi 里面向 coding agent 的套餐端点；官方示例环境变量为 ZAI_API_KEY。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "智谱AI 开放文档 — OpenAI API 兼容",
          "url": "https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/develop/openai/introduction"
        },
        {
          "title": "智谱AI 开放平台 — API 文档",
          "url": "https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/api/introduction"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "minimax",
      "displayName": "MiniMax",
      "piProvider": "minimax",
      "protocol": "anthropic-messages",
      "baseUrl": "https://api.minimax.io/anthropic",
      "envVar": "MINIMAX_API_KEY",
      "auth": { "header": "x-api-key" },
      "region": "global",
      "notes": "官方 Anthropic 兼容端点（api.minimax.io/anthropic）。官方同时给出 Anthropic SDK 的 ANTHROPIC_API_KEY 与 curl 的 Authorization: Bearer；本目录按 Anthropic Messages 协议使用 x-api-key，环境变量取 MINIMAX_API_KEY 以区分厂商。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "MiniMax API Docs — Anthropic SDK",
          "url": "https://platform.minimax.io/docs/api-reference/text-anthropic-api"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "openai",
      "displayName": "OpenAI",
      "piProvider": "openai",
      "protocol": "openai-responses",
      "baseUrl": "https://api.openai.com/v1",
      "envVar": "OPENAI_API_KEY",
      "auth": { "header": "Authorization", "scheme": "Bearer" },
      "notes": "官方 Responses API（POST {base}/responses），入口协议不使用 Chat Completions。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "OpenAI API — Developer quickstart",
          "url": "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/quickstart"
        },
        {
          "title": "OpenAI API reference — Responses",
          "url": "https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/responses"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "anthropic",
      "displayName": "Anthropic",
      "piProvider": "anthropic",
      "protocol": "anthropic-messages",
      "baseUrl": "https://api.anthropic.com",
      "envVar": "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY",
      "auth": { "header": "x-api-key" },
      "notes": "官方 Messages API（POST {base}/v1/messages）。官方也接受 Authorization: Bearer；API key 走 x-api-key。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Claude API — overview",
          "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/overview"
        },
        {
          "title": "Claude API — get started",
          "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/get-started"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gemini",
      "displayName": "Google Gemini",
      "piProvider": "google",
      "protocol": "google-generative-ai",
      "baseUrl": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta",
      "envVar": "GEMINI_API_KEY",
      "auth": { "header": "x-goog-api-key" },
      "region": "global",
      "notes": "官方 Gemini API v1beta；鉴权头 x-goog-api-key（也支持 key 查询参数）。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Gemini API — API keys",
          "url": "https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/api-key"
        },
        {
          "title": "Gemini API — v1beta discovery document",
          "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/$discovery/rest?version=v1beta"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "xai",
      "displayName": "xAI",
      "piProvider": "xai",
      "protocol": "openai-responses",
      "baseUrl": "https://api.x.ai/v1",
      "envVar": "XAI_API_KEY",
      "auth": { "header": "Authorization", "scheme": "Bearer" },
      "notes": "官方 Responses API（POST {base}/responses）。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "xAI Docs — Generate text",
          "url": "https://docs.x.ai/developers/model-capabilities/text/generate-text"
        },
        {
          "title": "xAI Docs — Quickstart",
          "url": "https://docs.x.ai/developers/quickstart"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "opencode-go",
      "displayName": "OpenCode GO",
      "piProvider": "opencode-go",
      "protocol": null,
      "baseUrl": null,
      "envVar": "OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY",
      "auth": { "header": "Authorization", "scheme": "Bearer" },
      "region": "global",
      "notes": "聚合网关：入口不设统一协议与地址，32 个模型各自带 api 与 baseUrl（https://opencode.ai/inference/go/...）。端点与 Bearer 鉴权按 OpenCode Console 文档；官方未规定环境变量名，本应用按 Provider ID 取 OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY（不采用 pi 内置的 OPENCODE_API_KEY）。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "OpenCode Console — Go",
          "url": "https://opencode.ai/docs/console/go/"
        },
        {
          "title": "OpenCode Console — Inference API",
          "url": "https://opencode.ai/docs/console/api/inference/"
        },
        {
          "title": "OpenCode Console — Harnesses",
          "url": "https://opencode.ai/docs/console/harnesses/"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
